      "headline": "Marketing at Epic Games, Fortnite ",
      "about": "I’m a marketing and partnerships leader with 8+ years of experience driving integrated marketing campaigns, brand activations, and go-to-market strategies across entertainment and tech.\n\nAt Epic Games, I lead studio and licensing partnerships for Fortnite, turning global IP partnerships with Disney, Marvel, Lucasfilm, Netflix, and more into culturally relevant marketing campaigns that reach audiences worldwide. I’ve managed over 20 campaigns in six months, generating $200M+ in revenue and leading cross-functional teams of 100+ people from strategy through launch.\n\nMy focus is on creating strategic brand partnerships that merge creative storytelling with data-driven decision making developing GTM playbooks, creative briefs, and campaign narratives that deliver measurable results.\n\nBefore Epic, I managed co-marketing and sponsorship activations at Activision Blizzard for Call of Duty and Overwatch Esports, achieving a 100% renewal rate with partners like Pepsi, Logitech, and Sony Japan through strong partner relationship management and ROI analysis.\n\nI love building partnerships that sit at the intersection of entertainment, technology and culture where creative ideas and brand storytelling meet strategy and performance.",
